    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Contact\"\ndescription: \"Contact details for Tristan Bereau at the Institute for Theoretical Physics, Heidelberg University.\"\nformat:\n    html:\n        include-in-header:\n            -   file: header_email.html\n        keep-hidden: true\n        echo: false\njupyter: python3\n---\n\n\n\n\n{{< fa phone >}} +49-6221-54-9448\n\n{{< fa at >}} <span id=\"email-placeholder\"></span>\n\n{{< fa door-open >}} Philosophenweg 19; 2nd floor; Room: 206\n\n\n\n\n{{< fa envelope >}}\n\n\n\n\n\n```\nInstitute for Theoretical Physics\nHeidelberg University\nPhilosophenweg 19\n69120 Heidelberg\nGermany\n```\n\n::: {#d7ec4248 .cell .column-screen execution_count=1}\n``` {.python .cell-code .hidden}\nfrom ipyleaflet import Map, Marker, basemaps, basemap_to_tiles\n\ncenter = (49.415, 8.698)\nm = Map(\n  basemap=basemap_to_tiles(basemaps.OpenStreetMap.Mapnik),\n  center=center,\n  zoom=15\n)\nm.add_layer(Marker(location=center))\nm\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```{=html}\n<script type=\"application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json\">\n{\"model_id\":\"f5e7fe8e9ea24a4899231f04d92b3dcf\",\"version_major\":2,\"version_minor\":0,\"quarto_mimetype\":\"application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json\"}\n</script>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n",
